{"id":20,"titleZh":"音乐厅的声音","titleEn":"The Sound of a Hall","date":"1962-11-21","dateZh":"1962 年 11 月 21 日","concepts":"音乐厅声学、回声与混响、清晰度与动态范围","thesis":"再出色的乐团也离不开好声学空间——理想的音乐厅需要在约两秒的柔和混响里，同时兼容耳语般的清晰细节与加农炮的巨响。","plain":"搬入林肯中心新建的爱乐厅之际，伯恩斯坦给小观众拆解声学门道。回声是刺耳的叠影，音乐需要的是持续约两秒、均匀饱满的“混响”；厅内的硬反射云板负责送声，软地毯和人体衣物负责吸音，因此调音期还要放上玻璃纤维吸音垫替代观众。","scenes":["奏完《罗马狂欢节》序曲后全团特意停住砸出短促干脆的尾音和弦，让观众静听约两秒混响；同时展示双耳假人头、示波器等调音道具，并当场打响一记手枪空包弹测试声音反射。","通过科普兰摇篮曲（亲密感）、维瓦尔第四小提琴协奏曲（清晰度）、故意将《门面》六位独奏分散站到舞台角落互听合奏（融合度）以及带台外大炮的《1812 序曲》（动态范围）完成新厅四项声学大考。"],"category":"基础乐理","bilibili":{"bvid":"BV1uT4y1J772","url":"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1uT4y1J772","title":"掘火中译：伯恩斯坦《年轻人的音乐会》| 音乐厅之声","duration":"53:21","uploader":"掘火档案（掘火中译）"},"scriptUrl":"https://leonardbernstein.com/lectures/television-scripts/young-peoples-concerts/sound-of-a-hall","repertoire":[{"composer":"Berlioz","piece":"Roman Carnival Overture, Op. 9","titleZh":"罗马狂欢节序曲","previewUrl":"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview221/v4/8e/21/f1/8e21f193-b6cd-d2a5-32ec-009bc2d9cd0d/mzaf_5368738200407231628.plus.aac.p.m4a","appleMusicUrl":"https://music.apple.com/us/album/roman-carnival-overture-op-9/258961582?i=258962022&uo=4","recordingArtist":"Charles Munch & Boston Symphony Orchestra","recordingTrack":"Roman Carnival Overture, Op. 9","youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Berlioz%20Roman%20Carnival%20Overture%2C%20Op.%209+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Berlioz%20Roman%20Carnival%20Overture%2C%20Op.%209"},{"composer":"Copland","piece":"The Little Horses (Old American Songs)","titleZh":"小马驹","previewUrl":null,"appleMusicUrl":null,"recordingArtist":null,"recordingTrack":null,"youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Copland%20The%20Little%20Horses+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Copland%20The%20Little%20Horses"},{"composer":"Vivaldi","piece":"Concerto for Four Violins in B Minor, Op. 3, No. 10","titleZh":"b